   "id": "95a51ae54bcce49aab23381f79ebc12ca4d7ee9a",
   "message": "fix(study): force x264 CFR so derived SPS carries fixed_frame_rate_flag1\n\nReviewed amendment bf9c5289 (technical COMMENT5993674923, PASS_WITH_NOTES).\nExtract the unchanged encoder argv into encode_command, add a real bounded\nregression that runs the production recipe through /usr/bin/ffmpeg and the\nstrict SPS/VUI validator (genuine RED on the old recipe, GREEN after\nforce-cfr=1), and install ffmpeg in CPU CI so the regression never skips.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
